- **SC-001**: Every Gherkin scenario has at least one automated test before merge.
- **SC-002**: Signed-in admin user can create, view, rename, and delete semesters on one screen.
- **SC-003**: Signed-in student user cannot access this view
- **SC-004**: `npm test` passes for semester API and dashboard semesters-view behavior.

